IndexNow key file
=================

The file `055c65c66919b6a17adda358f79932a7.txt` in this directory IS the IndexNow verification key. Its filename must equal its
contents; do not rename or edit it.

It lets Bing (and other participating engines — Yandex, Seznam, Naver) be told immediately when a
page changes, instead of waiting to be recrawled. Google does not participate.

Submitting is a single GET, e.g. after a deploy:

  curl "https://api.indexnow.org/indexnow?url=https://resomix.com/&key=055c65c66919b6a17adda358f79932a7"

Or submit many URLs at once by POSTing the JSON body documented at https://www.indexnow.org/documentation

NOTHING PINGS AUTOMATICALLY. This is only the verification file; wiring it into the deploy
pipeline is a deliberate step, because it notifies external services.
